a’s Cyber Security Defense Agency National Coordinator For Critical Infrastructure Secur\n\n## PREVIOUS ATTEMPT ERRORS (MUST FIX ON THIS RETRY):\n- Scenario 3/4 Validation Error (Attempt 1): [\"Layer 1 Error: Step 1 has step_type='command' but command is empty.\", \"Layer 1 Error: Step 5 has step_type='command' but command is empty.\"]\n- Scenario 3/4 Validation Error (Attempt 2): [\"Layer 1 Platform Error: Step 1 platform/provider 'CoreID Admin Console' is not registered. Recognized platforms: ['CoreID', 'airretailer', 'airretailer_vpn_rdp_tools', 'auth0', 'auth0_user_management', 'communication', 'coreid', 'coreid_user_management', 'email', 'email_service', 'l1_testing_platform_api', 'mock', 'phone', 'solandra', 'solandra_group', 'solandra_ticketing', 'system', 'verified_phone_channel', 'voice']\", \"Layer 1 Platform Error: Step 2 platform/provider 'CoreID Admin Console' is not registered. Recognized platforms: ['CoreID', 'airretailer', 'airretailer_vpn_rdp_tools', 'auth0', 'auth0_user_management', 'communication', 'coreid', 'coreid_user_management', 'email', 'email_service', 'l1_testing_platform_api', 'mock', 'phone', 'solandra', 'solandra_group', 'solandra_ticketing', 'system', 'verified_phone_channel', 'voice']\", \"Layer 1 Error: Step 3 has step_type='command' but command is empty.\"]"
